{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped At Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Sarah, an ordinary woman who, after coming home from her exhausting job late at night, has her house invaded by a notorious serial killer who is spreading terror throughout her city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/extras/6f462cbae9bee167be70258dbf23c969.poster.avif?t=1762053331\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/extras/6f462cbae9bee167be70258dbf23c969.webm?t=1762053331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/extras/6f462cbae9bee167be70258dbf23c969.mp4?t=1762053331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't feel like hiding or escaping, make him taste his own medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/extras/c8d7125b54d022a7c77ff55ae584c453.poster.avif?t=1762053331\" width=782 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/extras/c8d7125b54d022a7c77ff55ae584c453.webm?t=1762053331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/extras/c8d7125b54d022a7c77ff55ae584c453.mp4?t=1762053331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let him see you until you're ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanic of hiding in closets and behind objects that block vision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth to avoid being noticed by the serial killer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gameplay focused on stealth, you will need to finds ways arround the serial killer to find a way to escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542940?t=1762053331","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542940?t=1762053331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/c5ace15fcd9c5ac79c24015aafd1cb85dc666145/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762053331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542940/c5ace15fcd9c5ac79c24015aafd1cb85dc666145/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762053331","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains dark areas, scary sounds, intense music, mild violence, and blood splashes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped At Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Sarah, an ordinary woman who, after coming home from her exhausting job late at night, has her house invaded by a notorious serial killer who is spreading terror throughout her city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo